{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56114","headline":"步虚词 七 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严我九龙驾，乘虚以逍遥。\n八天如指掌，六合何足辽。\n衆真诵洞玄，太上唱清谣。\n香华随风散，玉音成紫霄。\n五苦一时迸，八难顺经寥。\n妙哉灵宝囿，兴此大法桥。\n（同前卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}